---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base title="The podcast" description={`The ${SITE.name} podcast: tradespeople and van owners on real costs, regrets and what they'd buy next.`}>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>The {SITE.name} podcast</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tradespeople, fleet managers and truck operators on going electric: what it really costs, what went wrong, and what they'd do differently. For listening in the cab.</p>
    <div class="notice"><strong>First episodes coming soon.</strong></div>
    <h2>What we'll cover</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Real running costs from people who switched to electric, and people who switched back</li>
      <li>Fleet managers on charging, drivers and getting the numbers to work</li>
      <li>Buying a used electric van: battery health and what dealers won't tell you</li>
      <li>Electric trucks: early operators on what works today</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Want to be on the show?</h2>
    <p>If you run a van, a fleet or trucks and have a story about going electric, good or bad, we'd like to hear from you.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
